  skos:scopeNote "Latin  spartum  can designate either the Spartium junceum (Spanish broom, retama, )  or the Stipa tenacissima (esparto, half grass, esparto grass, alfa, sparte). Only the first one having flowers which are able to produce honey, the meaning in Plin. XI 18 must be this."@fr .

