  dcterms:identifier "107966";
  dcterms:description "105780##107966", "107515##107966", "4996##4998##4999##5032##pcrtLeJDEv8jY1##108142##107966";
  skos:scopeNote "Plin. XI 114 describes the effects of this parasite without naming it. Cf. Arist. H.A. 557a 2.\\\\\\\\rHesychius mentions κάρ and κάρνος as synonyms of φθείρ, but etymologically these words are rather related to other kind of insect, the koris. Besides, ἄχωρ normally designates the scurf. (Beavis, Insects and... 1988, 112-114.)"@fr .

