  skos:scopeNote "Plin. X 66 mentions this bird as the guide of quails in their migration. André, Oiseaux 1967, 114, through the testimony of the Greek sources, identifies it as the corn crake (Crex crex), but Pliny does not establish any distinction of species between it and the quail."@fr .

